IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Terms and Conditions Governing UOB Preferred Visa Card`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. uob-preferred-visa-tnc: "Terms and Conditions Governing UOB
-- Preferred Visa Card (Formerly known as 'UOB Preferred Platinum Visa Card')",
-- "Updated 10 March 2026 (Ver 3.0)" (United Overseas Bank Limited). The
-- guidance FAQ (uob-preferred-visa-faq) concerns the rename and travel
-- insurance and says in Q3 "There will be no impact to your card's existing
-- functionality, benefits, or rewards".
--
-- THE STRUCTURE FROM 1 OCTOBER 2025 (cl.3(c)). This module answers for
-- purchases dated on or after 1 October 2025; the earlier structure is
-- superseded and is not encoded.
--   cl.2(a) UNI$10 per S$5 for Selected Online Transactions.
--   cl.2(c) UNI$10 per S$5 for Mobile Contactless Transactions.
--   cl.2(b) "With effect from 22 May 2020, UOB will cease the awarding of UNI$10
--           ... for all Contactless Transactions" (the physical card tapped).
--   cl.2(d) SimplyGo (ABT): "With effect from 28 Aug 2025, SimplyGo (ABT)
--           Transactions will be treated as Mobile Contactless Transactions."
--   cl.2(e) UNI$1 per S$5 for all Other Retail Transactions.
--   cl.3(c)(i)-(ii) "The UNI$10 ... is comprised of a basic UNI$1 earned plus a
--           bonus UNI$9. The bonus UNI$ ... is capped at UNI$1,080 for each
--           calendar month." (UNI$1,080 / 9 x 5 = S$600 of spend.)
--   cl.3(c)(iv) "Selected Online Transactions and Mobile Contactless
--           Transactions are treated as separate categories. Each category has
--           its own separate bonus UNI$ cap."
--   cl.1(a)(vi) "Mobile Contactless Transactions" = Apple Pay, Google Pay,
--           Samsung Pay "that is effected at any Visa payWave Readers by waving
--           the mobile device against the physical Visa payWave Readers
--           in-person at the merchant's physical store. In-app transactions
--           made via Apple Pay, Google Pay and Samsung Pay ... do not
--           constitute 'Mobile Contactless Transactions'."
--   cl.1(a)(ix) "Selected Online Transactions" = "online retail Card
--           Transactions (whether made locally or overseas) via websites ...
--           provided that such merchant falls within any one of the following
--           Merchant Category Codes (MCC) and the transaction must not be under
--           any recurring payment arrangement", in three families.
--   cl.2(f) What earns nothing: a long list (below).
--
-- THE FORKS.
--   F-uob-per-five: "UNI$10 for every S$5": whole blocks or pro rata. Floor on
--     blocks, ceiling on pro rata (earn-kernel.l4).
--   F-pv-app: "via websites". A purchase made with the wallet in an app, or with
--     card details held on file, may or may not be "via websites"; the card
--     number typed into a site is. The module gives the two the base rate as a
--     floor and the online rate as a ceiling and names the open reading.
--   F-pv-simplygo: SimplyGo is "treated as Mobile Contactless Transactions"
--     "subject to all the terms ... applicable to Mobile Contactless
--     Transactions". Those terms require a mobile device in the definition at
--     cl.1(a)(vi); SimplyGo's own definition (cl.1(a)(vii)) covers "the Card or
--     mobile device". A physical-card tap of a bus or train fare therefore
--     either earns UNI$10 in the Mobile Contactless pot or UNI$1. Floor UNI$1,
--     ceiling the Mobile Contactless rate, condition named.
--   F-bill-payments: cl.2(f)(v) excludes "all transactions in relation to or
--     in connection with bill payment, top-ups and payment of funds to
--     payment service providers or prepaid accounts". Floor 0 for a bill paid
--     directly on the card, ceiling the full earn.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.2(f) -- what earns nothing`

GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the Preferred Visa excluded category codes` MEANS
    LIST 4829, 4900, 5199, 5960, 5965, 5993, 6012, 6050, 6051, 6211, 6300, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534,
         6540, 7349, 7511, 7523, 7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661,
         8699, 8999, 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405

GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PV cl.2(f) excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN FALSE

-- cl.2(f)(vi): the thirty-two listed descriptions (the asterisk "includes any
-- combination or derivation").
GIVEN d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PV cl.2(f)(vi) lists the description` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `AXS`                                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Amaze`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Amaze with a transit or payment counterparty`         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `EZ-Link`                                              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `FlashPay`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `NETS VCashCard`                                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `TRANSIT`                                              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Transit Link`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Razerpay`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SingPost-SAM`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `iPayMy`                                               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SmoovPay`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal Bizconsulta or Capitalroya or Oandaasiapa`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Moneybookers`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Skrill`                                               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `OANDA`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Saxo`                                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `IG Markets`                                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SkyFX`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Banc de Binary`                                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `RWS-Levy`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `NORWDS`                                               THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                                                        FALSE

-- cl.2(f)(iv): "any transactions or payments made to SPC Service Stations and
-- Shell Service Stations".
GIVEN seller IS A Merchant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PV cl.2(f)(iv) excludes the merchant` seller MEANS
    seller EQUALS `SPC service station` OR seller EQUALS `Shell service station`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Preferred Visa excludes the purchase` p MEANS
    `PV cl.2(f) excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`)
    OR `the code is among` p `the Preferred Visa excluded category codes`
    OR `PV cl.2(f)(vi) lists the description` (p's descriptor)
    OR `PV cl.2(f)(iv) excludes the merchant` (p's merchant)
    OR p's `later reversed`


§§ `cl.1(a)(ix) -- the Selected Online MCCs`

-- Department Stores and Retail Stores: 4816, 5262, 5306, 5309, 5310, 5311,
-- 5331, 5399, 5611, 5621, 5631, 5641, 5651, 5661, 5691, 5699, 5732-5735, 5912,
-- 5942, 5944-5949, 5964, 5966-5970, 5992, 5999 (5965 removed from 1 October
-- 2024). Supermarkets, Dining and Food Delivery: 5811, 5812, 5814, 5333, 5411,
-- 5441, 5462, 5499, 8012, 9751. Entertainment and Ticketing: 7278, 7832, 7841,
-- 7922, 7991, 7996, 7998-7999.
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the Preferred Visa Selected Online category codes` MEANS
    LIST 4816, 5262, 5306, 5309, 5310, 5311, 5331, 5399, 5611, 5621, 5631, 5641, 5651, 5661, 5691,
         5699, 5732, 5733, 5734, 5735, 5912, 5942, 5944, 5945, 5946, 5947, 5948, 5949, 5964, 5966,
         5967, 5968, 5969, 5970, 5992, 5999, 5811, 5812, 5814, 5333, 5411, 5441, 5462, 5499, 8012,
         9751, 7278, 7832, 7841, 7922, 7991, 7996, 7998, 7999


§§ `Which pot a purchase draws on`

-- Mobile Contactless: a wallet tapped on a reader at a physical store (not in an
-- app, not by magnetic secure transmission, which is not a payWave tap).
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is a Mobile Contactless Transaction` p MEANS
    p's presentation EQUALS `Wallet tapped on a reader`
    AND NOT (p's `store location` EQUALS `Not a store`)

-- SimplyGo (ABT) fares "will be treated as Mobile Contactless Transactions"
-- with effect from 28 August 2025 (cl.2(d)).
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is a SimplyGo fare treated as Mobile Contactless` p MEANS
    p's merchant EQUALS `SimplyGo`
    AND p's item EQUALS `A SimplyGo bus or train fare`
    AND p's `date charged` AT LEAST Date 28 8 2025

-- Before that date a SimplyGo fare was an ordinary UNI$1 per S$5 transaction
-- (cl.2(d): "UNI$1 for every S$5 ... for SimplyGo (ABT) Transactions").
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is a SimplyGo fare before it was treated as Mobile Contactless` p MEANS
    p's merchant EQUALS `SimplyGo`
    AND p's item EQUALS `A SimplyGo bus or train fare`
    AND p's `date charged` LESS THAN Date 28 8 2025

-- ... on the phone the reading is settled; with the physical card it is the
-- open reading F-pv-simplygo.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the SimplyGo fare is tapped with the physical card` p MEANS
    `the purchase is a SimplyGo fare treated as Mobile Contactless` p
    AND p's presentation EQUALS `Physical card tapped on a reader`

-- Online presentations that are plainly "via websites".
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase was plainly made via a website` p MEANS
    p's presentation EQUALS `Card number entered online`

-- Online presentations that may or may not be "via websites" (fork F-pv-app).
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase may have been made in an app` p MEANS
    p's presentation EQUALS `Wallet used in an app or on a website`
    OR p's presentation EQUALS `Card details held on file by the merchant`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the code of the purchase is a Selected Online code` p MEANS
    `the code is among` p `the Preferred Visa Selected Online category codes`


§§ `The arithmetic: a basic UNI$1 and a bonus UNI$9 per S$5, the bonus capped`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Preferred Visa bonus UNI$ cap per category per calendar month` MEANS 1080

-- On whole S$5 blocks. Returns the total UNI$ for the transaction, the bonus
-- limited to the pot's room, the sum rounded down.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, soFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`PV UNI$ at the bonus rate by blocks` amount soFar MEANS
    FLOOR ((FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)) PLUS (min ((FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)) TIMES 9) (`at least nothing` (`the Preferred Visa bonus UNI$ cap per category per calendar month` MINUS soFar))))

-- Pro rata.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, soFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`PV UNI$ at the bonus rate pro rata` amount soFar MEANS
    FLOOR ((amount DIVIDED BY 5) PLUS (min ((amount TIMES 9) DIVIDED BY 5) (`at least nothing` (`the Preferred Visa bonus UNI$ cap per category per calendar month` MINUS soFar))))

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, soFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`PV bonus UNI$ wanted by blocks` amount soFar MEANS
    (FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)) TIMES 9

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`PV UNI$ at the base rate by blocks` amount MEANS
    FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`PV UNI$ at the base rate pro rata` amount MEANS
    FLOOR (amount DIVIDED BY 5)


§§ `The answer when the code is settled`

-- UNI$ = 2 miles, held in the Lady's, PRVI and other UOB T&Cs and not in this
-- one; this document says only "UNI$". The module takes the PRVI T&C's
-- "UNI$1 = 2 miles" (cl.1(i)), the programme's conversion, as the conversion.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`miles per UNI$ for the Preferred Visa` MEANS 2

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      soFar IS A NUMBER
      pot IS A Pot
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PV answer at the bonus rate` c p soFar pot MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `UNI$` `of` (`PV UNI$ at the bonus rate by blocks` (p's `amount in SGD`) soFar) `to` (`PV UNI$ at the bonus rate pro rata` (p's `amount in SGD`) soFar) `wanting` (`PV bonus UNI$ wanted by blocks` (p's `amount in SGD`) soFar) `at` (JUST `miles per UNI$ for the Preferred Visa`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` pot `depending on` (`PV rounding conditions for` (p's `amount in SGD`) soFar) `per` "UOB Preferred Visa T&C cl.2(a), 2(c), 3(c)"

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, soFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF Condition
`PV rounding conditions for` amount soFar MEANS
    IF `PV UNI$ at the bonus rate by blocks` amount soFar EQUALS `PV UNI$ at the bonus rate pro rata` amount soFar
    THEN EMPTY
    ELSE LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PV answer at the base rate` c p MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `UNI$` `of` (`PV UNI$ at the base rate by blocks` (p's `amount in SGD`)) `to` (`PV UNI$ at the base rate pro rata` (p's `amount in SGD`)) `wanting` 0 `at` (JUST `miles per UNI$ for the Preferred Visa`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` `No pot` `depending on` (`PV rounding conditions for` (p's `amount in SGD`) 0) `per` "UOB Preferred Visa T&C cl.2(e)"

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Preferred Visa month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PV answer when the code is settled` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Preferred Visa excludes the purchase` p
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `UNI$` `per` "UOB Preferred Visa T&C cl.2(f)"
        IF `the purchase is a SimplyGo fare before it was treated as Mobile Contactless` p
            THEN `PV answer at the base rate` c p
        IF `the SimplyGo fare is tapped with the physical card` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PV answer at the base rate` c p) `to` (`PV answer at the bonus rate` c p (m's `mobile contactless bonus UNI$`) `Preferred Visa mobile contactless`) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        IF `the purchase is a Mobile Contactless Transaction` p OR `the purchase is a SimplyGo fare treated as Mobile Contactless` p
            THEN `PV answer at the bonus rate` c p (m's `mobile contactless bonus UNI$`) `Preferred Visa mobile contactless`
        IF `the purchase was plainly made via a website` p AND `the code of the purchase is a Selected Online code` p
            THEN `PV answer at the bonus rate` c p (m's `selected online bonus UNI$`) `Preferred Visa selected online`
        IF `the purchase may have been made in an app` p AND `the code of the purchase is a Selected Online code` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PV answer at the base rate` c p) `to` (`PV answer at the bonus rate` c p (m's `selected online bonus UNI$`) `Preferred Visa selected online`) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        OTHERWISE `PV answer at the base rate` c p

GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PV earns nothing under the open reading` c MEANS
    `nothing is earned on` c `in` `UNI$` `per` "UOB Preferred Visa T&C cl.2(f)(v) (open reading)"

-- A code that earns the bonus on a pot, and a code that is excluded, for the
-- best-case and worst-case evaluations when the code is not known.
`a Preferred Visa code that is excluded` MEANS 4829
`a Preferred Visa code that earns the bonus` MEANS 5812

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Preferred Visa month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the code is unknown for` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PV answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Preferred Visa code that is excluded`) m) `to` (`PV answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Preferred Visa code that earns the bonus`) m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
        IF p's `charge kind` EQUALS `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PV earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`PV answer when the code is settled` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        OTHERWISE `PV answer when the code is settled` c p m


§§ `The clock the Preferred Visa pots runs on`

-- cl.3(c) ("for each calendar month"); cl.1(a)(iv) says "captured or posted on UOB's systems".
GIVETH A `Period basis`
`the Preferred Visa pots' period` MEANS `Calendar month`

GIVETH A `Date basis`
`the Preferred Visa pots' date basis` MEANS `Not stated in the document`

#ASSERT `the Preferred Visa pots' period` EQUALS `Calendar month`
#ASSERT `the Preferred Visa pots' date basis` EQUALS `Not stated in the document`


§§ `Illustrations`

`a Preferred Visa` MEANS `UOB Preferred Visa`

GIVEN wallet IS A NUMBER, online IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Preferred Visa month`
`a Preferred Visa month with` wallet `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` online `in the online pot` MEANS
    `Preferred Visa month` WITH
        `mobile contactless bonus UNI$` IS wallet
        `selected online bonus UNI$`    IS online

`a fresh Preferred Visa month` MEANS `a Preferred Visa month with` 0 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 0 `in the online pot`

`S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` MEANS `purchase paid by` `the base purchase` `Wallet tapped on a reader`
`S$100 by the physical card tapped at a restaurant` MEANS `the base purchase`
`S$100 online at a department store` MEANS `purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5311) `Card number entered online`
`S$100 online at a charging app` MEANS `purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5552) `Card number entered online`
`S$100 by Apple Pay inside an app at a department store` MEANS `purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5311) `Wallet used in an app or on a website`

-- cl.2(c), cl.3(c): Apple Pay tapped, S$100: UNI$10 per S$5 -> 20 blocks -> 200 UNI$ = 400 miles.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `miles certain`) EQUALS 400
-- ... any MCC not excluded: a pet shop (5995) and a parking-free clinic (8099) earn the same.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 5995) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 8099) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- cl.2(b): the physical card tapped earns UNI$1 per S$5: 20 UNI$ = 40 miles.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by the physical card tapped at a restaurant` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- cl.1(a)(vi): in-app Apple Pay is not Mobile Contactless; at a non-listed MCC it earns the base rate.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5995) `Wallet used in an app or on a website`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20

-- cl.2(a), cl.1(a)(ix): online at a listed MCC (5311): UNI$10 per S$5.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 online at a department store` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- ... at EV charging (5552, not on the list): base only.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 online at a charging app` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... a recurring payment arrangement is not a Selected Online Transaction.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase paid by` `S$100 online at a department store` `Recurring payment arrangement`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... in an app: the open reading F-pv-app (floor 20, ceiling 200).
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay inside an app at a department store` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay inside an app at a department store` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT elem `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)` ((`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay inside an app at a department store` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `depends on`)

-- cl.3(c): the bonus is capped at UNI$1,080 per category per calendar month = S$600 of spend.
-- With 1,000 bonus UNI$ already in the wallet pot, S$100 earns 20 basic + 80 bonus (the room) = 100.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` (`a Preferred Visa month with` 1000 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 0 `in the online pot`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
-- ... with the pot full, only the 20 basic UNI$ remain.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` (`a Preferred Visa month with` 1080 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 0 `in the online pot`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... bonus wanted before the cap is 20 blocks x 9 = 180, whatever the pot holds.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` (`a Preferred Visa month with` 1080 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 0 `in the online pot`))'s `bonus units before cap` EQUALS 180
-- cl.3(c)(iv): separate pots. A full wallet pot does not touch the online pot.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 online at a department store` (`a Preferred Visa month with` 1080 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 0 `in the online pot`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 online at a department store` (`a Preferred Visa month with` 0 `bonus UNI$ in the wallet pot and` 1080 `in the online pot`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- The pot named in the answer:
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s pot EQUALS `Preferred Visa mobile contactless`
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `S$100 online at a department store` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s pot EQUALS `Preferred Visa selected online`

-- cl.2(d): SimplyGo (ABT) from 28 August 2025 is Mobile Contactless: by phone, UNI$10 per S$5.
`a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by phone` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase of item` (`purchase at merchant` (`purchase paid by` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 4111) `Wallet tapped on a reader`) `SimplyGo`) `A SimplyGo bus or train fare`) 10
`a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by the physical card` MEANS `purchase paid by` `a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by phone` `Physical card tapped on a reader`
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by phone` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... by the physical card, the open reading F-pv-simplygo: floor UNI$2, ceiling UNI$20.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by the physical card` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` `a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by the physical card` `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 20
-- ... before 28 August 2025 a SimplyGo fare was a basic-rate transaction.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase charged on` `a SimplyGo fare of S$10 by phone` (Date 1 8 2025)) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 2

-- Per S$5: S$4.99 by Apple Pay earns 0 on blocks and 9 pro rata (0.998 basic + 8.982 bonus = 9.98 down), and S$9.99 earns 10 on blocks, 19 pro rata.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase for` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 4.99) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase for` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 4.99) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 9
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase for` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 9.99) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase for` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 9.99) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 19

-- cl.2(f): nothing on a bill payment, an instalment plan, a listed MCC, a listed description, SPC or Shell, or a reversal.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Bill payment`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Instalment plan charge`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `NETS or NETS-related transaction`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 7523) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` 8062) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase described as` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Amaze`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase at merchant` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Shell service station`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase at merchant` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `SPC service station`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase later reversed` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s excluded

-- A bill paid directly on the card: the open reading.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 200

-- The MCC not known: floor 0 (it might be excluded), ceiling the bonus.
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase with unknown code` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase with unknown code` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT elem `The merchant category code is not known` ((`UOB Preferred Visa earns on` `a Preferred Visa` (`purchase with unknown code` `S$100 by Apple Pay tapped at a restaurant`) `a fresh Preferred Visa month`)'s `depends on`)

